Third-party software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

H3 Studio talks to ComfyUI over its HTTP API and does not import, link
against, or bundle any ComfyUI code. ComfyUI is a separate program, licensed
under the GNU General Public License v3.0, which you install and run yourself.

    ComfyUI - https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI - GPL-3.0

The user interface is built with Gradio, licensed under the Apache License 2.0
and installed as an ordinary dependency.

    Gradio - https://github.com/gradio-app/gradio - Apache-2.0

Clip chaining and joining shell out to ffmpeg if it is installed on your
system. ffmpeg is not bundled with this project.

    FFmpeg - https://ffmpeg.org/ - LGPL-2.1+/GPL-2+ depending on build

